  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/hi9moJH.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/417/339/line.png\"></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><strong>「 MODDED COMPATIBILITY v3.10.1 」</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><em>也歡迎社群貢獻！只需&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/vizthex123/StonebornModdedCompat/pulls\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">開啟一個 PR</a>，您的 UI 就能被加入這個包中，並獲得完整的貢獻者標示。</em></h2><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><em>您也可以在 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fNtwzA6X\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a>上尋求支援或回報問題。</em></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><em><strong>「 查看 STONEBORN 包（必備） 」</strong></em></span></h1><p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/stoneborn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/417/673/ui.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"156\" height=\"156\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/417/339/line.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">「 700 萬 」下載次數！真心感謝。收錄於「 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/medieval-mc-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Medieval MC [FABRIC]</a> 」</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/medieval-mc-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/489/55/medievallogo.png\" width=\"244\" height=\"76\"></span></a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/417/339/line.png\" height=\"32\"></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">.fsh 著色器。現在所有 GUI 標題和容器標題都變為橘色/金色。達到最大相容性！</span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">若您偏好預設文字而非金色，請刪除 .fsh 著色器</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:14px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/hOSFIUm.png\" width=\"274\" height=\"390\"></span>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\"><em>請盡情享受 STONEBORN 為超過 200 個模組提供的重新紋理，包括 Create、Quark、JEI、REI、AE2、Biomancy、Sophisticated Backpacks、Iron Chests、Curios、Trinkets 以及更多！</em></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">請在留言區或 <a href=\"https://github.com/vizthex123/StonebornModdedCompat/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">問題追蹤器</a>上提出新增請求。</span></em></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/417/339/line.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">「 支援的模組 」</span></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<em>如需完整支援模組列表 →<strong> <a href=\"https://github.com/vizthex123/StonebornModdedCompat/blob/main/CFAssets/supported_mods.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">請點此查看</a>。 </strong>←</em></p><ol>\n<li>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/adorn-for-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;Adorn&nbsp;</span></span></span></a></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\n<li>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-mobs\" rel=\"nofollow\">&nbsp;Alex's Mobs&nbsp;</a></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\n<li>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alloy-forgery\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alloy Forgery</a>&nbsp;</span></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\n<li>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/apotheosis\" rel=\"nofollow\">&nbsp;Apotheosis&nbsp;</a></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\n<li>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/appleskin\" rel=\"nofollow\">&nbsp;Appleskin&nbsp;</a></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\n<li>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/applied-energistics-2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Applied Energistics 2</a>&nbsp;</span></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\n<li>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquaculture\" rel=\"nofollow\">